    "Park alerts are busy. Check current conditions on nps.gov.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Parkhinweise sind gerade überlastet. Sieh die aktuellen Bedingungen auf nps.gov nach."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Park alerts are busy. Check current conditions on nps.gov."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las alertas del parque están saturadas. Consulta las condiciones actuales en nps.gov."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le service des alertes du parc est saturé. Consultez les conditions actuelles sur nps.gov."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "公園のアラートが混み合っています。nps.govで現在の状況を確認してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Park alerts use a key every copy of Nyx shares, limited to 1,000 requests an hour. If alerts are often busy, you can use a free key of your own from the National Park Service. It stays in this device's Keychain and is sent only to developer.nps.gov.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parkhinweise nutzen einen Schlüssel, den alle Kopien von Nyx teilen, begrenzt auf 1.000 Anfragen pro Stunde. Wenn die Hinweise oft überlastet sind, kannst du einen eigenen kostenlosen Schlüssel vom National Park Service verwenden. Er bleibt im Schlüsselbund dieses Geräts und wird nur an developer.nps.gov gesendet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Park alerts use a key every copy of Nyx shares, limited to 1,000 requests an hour. If alerts are often busy, you can use a free key of your own from the National Park Service. It stays in this device's Keychain and is sent only to developer.nps.gov."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las alertas de los parques usan una clave que comparten todas las copias de Nyx, limitada a 1,000 solicitudes por hora. Si las alertas suelen estar saturadas, puedes usar tu propia clave gratuita del National Park Service. Se guarda en el llavero de este dispositivo y solo se envía a developer.nps.gov."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les alertes des parcs utilisent une clé partagée par toutes les copies de Nyx, limitée à 1 000 requêtes par heure. Si les alertes sont souvent saturées, vous pouvez utiliser votre propre clé gratuite du National Park Service. Elle reste dans le trousseau de cet appareil et n’est envoyée qu’à developer.nps.gov."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "公園のアラートには、すべてのNyxで共有するキーを使っていて、1時間に1,000リクエストまでに制限されています。アラートがよく混み合う場合は、National Park Serviceから無料で取得できる自分のキーを使えます。キーはこのデバイスのキーチェーンに保存され、developer.nps.govにだけ送信されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
