    "The darkest nights. Only earthshine on the Moon's face.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die dunkelsten Nächte. Nur Erdschein auf dem Gesicht des Mondes."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The darkest nights. Only earthshine on the Moon's face."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las noches más oscuras. Solo la luz cenicienta en la cara de la Luna."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les nuits les plus noires. Seule la lumière cendrée éclaire la face de la Lune."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最も暗い夜。月面には地球照だけが見えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The darkest park in reach for each night you are free.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der dunkelste Park in Reichweite für jede Nacht, in der du frei hast."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The darkest park in reach for each night you are free."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El parque más oscuro a tu alcance para cada noche que tienes libre."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le parc le plus sombre à portée pour chaque nuit où vous êtes libre."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空いている夜ごとに、行ける範囲でいちばん暗い公園。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The darkest sky among your saved parks, or one park you choose, with forecast limits and closures shown.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der dunkelste Himmel unter deinen gespeicherten Parks oder einem Park deiner Wahl, mit den Grenzen der Vorhersage und Sperrungen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The darkest sky among your saved parks, or one park you choose, with forecast limits and closures shown."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El cielo más oscuro entre tus parques guardados, o un parque que elijas, con los límites del pronóstico y los cierres a la vista."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le ciel le plus noir parmi vos parcs enregistrés, ou un parc de votre choix, avec les limites de la prévision et les fermetures affichées."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存した公園のうちいちばん暗い空、または選んだ一つの公園の空。予報の限界と閉鎖情報も表示します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The darkest stretch this month has passed or falls just beyond it. Look ahead to plan it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die dunkelste Serie dieses Monats ist vorbei oder liegt knapp danach. Schau voraus, um sie zu planen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The darkest stretch this month has passed or falls just beyond it. Look ahead to plan it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El tramo más oscuro de este mes ya pasó o cae justo después. Mira más adelante para planearlo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La période la plus sombre du mois est passée ou tombe juste après. Regardez plus loin pour la préparer."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今月いちばん暗い連夜は、すでに過ぎたか、月が変わってすぐにあります。先の月を見て計画してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The darkness score at a park, or at your darkest saved park.": {
